        "original_id": "5e00c02d-4083-51e9-a0bb-3af64f37d9e3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Robert Jan van Pelt, Deborah Lipstadt, David Irving\n- Events: Irving v. Lipstadt civil libel suit\n- Works: The Destruction of Dresden, Hitler's War, Churchill's War, Goebbels: Mastermind of the Third Reich\n\nFacts:\n- In 1963, David Irving published The Destruction of Dresden.\n- In 1977, David Irving published Hitler's War.\n- In 1987, David Irving published Churchill's War.\n- In 1996, David Irving published Goebbels: Mastermind of the Third Reich.\n- Robert Jan van Pelt served as an expert witness in Deborah Lipstadt's successful defence in the civil libel suit brought against her by David Irving.",
